---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const tools = [
  "Motor",
  "NM Slick Monel",
  "NM Flex Monel",
  "NM Pony",
  "NM Stabilizer Carrier",
  "Stabilized Sub",
  "Subs",
  "Lifting Subs",
  "Jars",
  "Shock Sub",
  "Exciter / Agitator / Sidewinder",
  "Orbit",
];
---
<Base title="How StrapSheets works" description="The twelve standard tools and the path from measurement to PDF.">
  <h1>How it works</h1>
  <ol>
    <li>Pick the job number and the tool.</li>
    <li>Enter the serial, the ends, the threads, and the measurements the sheet asks for.</li>
    <li>Confirm the card. The phone draws the PDF on the device.</li>
    <li>Send opens your mail app with the PDF attached. You press Send there.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>The twelve tools</h2>
  <ul>
    {tools.map((tool) => <li>{tool}</li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>A thirteenth tool, Custom, lets you mark a tube yourself. That builder is part of Pro.</p>
</Base>
